识的知识，但是这知识仍然在那里，因为——显然——我用过这知识……需要依靠大量的冥想和清空，才能把整个东西找回来——我是说有意识的知识——不过如果你愿意的话，你是可以做到的。如果你足够开放自我的话。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 13, "reviewId": "17408780_7Jp6HevLT", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688279538, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "29103036", "format": "epub", "version": 812418705, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/36/29103036/s_29103036.jpg", "title": "九故事", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "丁骏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 13, "chapterTitle": "泰迪", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JnOeZgwi", "review": {"bookId": "29103036", "content": "第七次", "bookVersion": 469730128, "range": "5690-5799", "abstract": "“我要那架照相机，泰迪。你听见我的话了吗？我要你马上从那只包上下来，我还要那架照相机在五分钟之内回这个房间——不然的话，就有一个小天才要上失踪名单了。你听清楚了吗？”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 13, "reviewId": "17408780_7JnOeZgwi", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688205830, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "29103036", "format": "epub", "version": 812418705, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/36/29103036/s_29103036.jpg", "title": "九故事", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "丁骏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 13, "chapterTitle": "泰迪", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2