content": "塞林格描写小孩儿真是太拿手了，他一定非常喜欢小孩儿，不仅仅是可爱的小孩儿。", "bookVersion": 469730128, "range": "8324-8381", "abstract": "查尔斯睁开一双超大的眼睛，表示已经听到姐姐的威胁，除此之外也没显得特别在意。他又闭上眼睛，继续把半边脸搁在椅子上。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 10, "reviewId": "17408780_7JkLn4wAR", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688032800, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "29103036", "format": "epub", "version": 812418705, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/36/29103036/s_29103036.jpg", "title": "九故事", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "丁骏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "为艾斯美而写——有爱也有污秽", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 4, "likesCount": 5, "friendLikesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JkscnnNY", "review": {"bookId": "29103036", "content": "一个等待爸爸回家的孩子，一个心思敏感的母亲。", "chapterUid": 9, "type": 1, "bookVersion": 469730128, "reviewId": "17408780_7JkscnnNY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688015235, "contextAbstract": "在小船里\n那是深秋季", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "29103036", "format": "epub", "version": 812418705, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/36/29103036/s_29103036.jpg", "title": "九故事", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "丁骏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "在小船里", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JkfIBF3V", "review": {"bookId": "29103036", "content": "这一段开头信息量巨大，交代了两个人的身份背景，并且抛出了一个悬念，为什么要往返十多次？", "bookVersion": 469730128, "range": "401-731", "abstract": "那是深秋季节一个小阳春的午后，四点刚过。女佣桑德拉从厨房临湖的窗子边走开，嘴巴抿得紧紧的，自中午以来，她已经这样来回地走了不下十五二十次了。这一次，她一边走着，一边心不在焉地把围裙的带子解开又系上，在她那肥大腰身允许的范围内把围裙系带收到了最紧。接着她走回到珐琅桌边上，把自己那穿着一身新制服的身子塞进了斯内尔太太对面的椅子里。斯内尔太太已经做完清洁和熨烫，正照例在走去公共汽车站之前喝一杯茶。斯内尔太太戴着帽子，就是她一直戴的那顶挺有意思的黑色毡帽，不光戴了这一整夏，而且戴了过去整整三个夏天——经历过创历史纪录的高温天，经历过生活的变迁，俯瞰过无数的熨衣板，还有一个又一个的吸尘器。“卡内基”的标签还贴在帽子里，已经旧了（也许可以这么说），但依然坚守阵地。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "reviewId": "17408780_7JkfIBF3V", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688003802, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "29103036", "format": "epub", "version": 812418705, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/36/29103036/s_29103036.jpg", "title": "九故事", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "丁骏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "在小船里", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JhSfautQ", "review": {"bookId": "29103036", "content": "塞林格处处透着美式幽默，拿车隐喻头领的心理和生理状态。", "bookVersion": 469730128, "range": "5532-5579", "abstract": "然后车子发动起来，跟往常不一样的是，车身竟然很业余地往前猛冲了一下。我们全体科曼切人鸦雀无声。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7JhSfautQ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1687868695, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "29103036", "format": "epub", "version": 812418705, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/36/29103036/s_29103036.jpg", "title": "九故事", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "丁骏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "笑面人", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JhRPCnl9", "review": {"bookId": "29103036", "content": "好故事的力量，可以让小孩们活在幻想中，也可以让成人疯狂。", "bookVersion": 469730128, "range": "4192-4243", "abstract": "事实上，我并不是笑面人唯一的合法后裔。我们的团队里有二十五个科曼切人，或者说二十五个笑面人的合法后裔。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7JhRPCnl9", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1687868318, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "29103036", "format": "epub", "version": 812418705, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/36/29103036/s_29103036.jpg", "title": "九故事", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "丁骏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "笑面人", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2z